  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_01",
      "hash": "9afa4a3aa9c825e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MOM: Oh, how cute! This is the one you got\\nfrom the professor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_02",
      "hash": "9afa493aa9c82433",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...What? You caught it yourself?!\\nThat’s amazing!\\c\\nWhat should I call your new friend?\\n...[VAR PKNICK(0003)]? It’s a lovely Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_01",
      "hash": "57ee1af82b92f090",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pikachuuuu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_02",
      "hash": "57ee1df82b92f5a9",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Eeveeeee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_03",
      "hash": "9afa483aa9c82280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MOM: My, how energetic!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_05",
      "hash": "9afa4e3aa9c82cb2",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I suppose that means you two will be setting off\\non an adventure today, right?\\c\\nI thought this day might come soon, so I\\nplanned ahead and got this for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_01",
      "hash": "f7649187e2f0b6be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got a [VAR COLOR(0006)]Town Map[VAR COLOR(0000)] from Mom!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_02",
      "hash": "f7649087e2f0b50b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_04",
      "hash": "9afa4f3aa9c82e65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "By using that Town Map in your Bag, you’ll\\nalways know exactly where you are.\\c\\nSafe travels, dear! You and [VAR PKNICK(0003)] be\\ngood to each other!"
    }
  ],
